    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/20aff6ff818c7b412bcde37fbcc4d9dc.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>A star changed the laws of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They changed the laws of humanity, and you can change everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letum</strong> was once a paradise until the star <strong>Potens</strong> miraculously turned into a black hole and something ancient heard its call. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They came not to destroy, but to convert cities into towering monoliths, people into the aliens' own entertainment and the sky into a prison. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now deep, buried within the aliens' monoliths, one survivor rose. Armed with scrap and objects carved from gravity itself. only you can undo the horrific changes they have made. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight like a machine with soul and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/f55e81e8a07e766fa4c473e93cffa428.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a wide range of brutal and dynamic combat encounters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic weapon and expand its power using scraps you find along your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade yourself using powerful relics that can alter the very physics around you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Monoliths shifting maze:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedural labyrinth reconfigures around you, lets just hope you can persuade its direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedy and energetic enemies make for a challenging combat experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve deeper into Letum's broken mind.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues along the way to help you puzzle together the horrifying truth that is Letum and its inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a story where reality and imagination blur.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden secrets and fun game modes to really give you a challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/063644661bd1b7fdc0d727d463de59a3.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor you climb could very well be your breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fight like a machine with soul and purpose.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/a0454cadb72ef7878058a086470bcf7f.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/20aff6ff818c7b412bcde37fbcc4d9dc.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br>A star changed the laws of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They changed the laws of humanity, and you can change everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letum</strong> was once a paradise until the star <strong>Potens</strong> miraculously turned into a black hole and something ancient heard its call. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They came not to destroy, but to convert cities into towering monoliths, people into the aliens' own entertainment and the sky into a prison. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now deep, buried within the aliens' monoliths, one survivor rose. Armed with scrap and objects carved from gravity itself. only you can undo the horrific changes they have made. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight like a machine with soul and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/f55e81e8a07e766fa4c473e93cffa428.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a wide range of brutal and dynamic combat encounters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic weapon and expand its power using scraps you find along your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade yourself using powerful relics that can alter the very physics around you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Monoliths shifting maze:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedural labyrinth reconfigures around you, lets just hope you can persuade its direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedy and energetic enemies make for a challenging combat experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve deeper into Letum's broken mind.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues along the way to help you puzzle together the horrifying truth that is Letum and its inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a story where reality and imagination blur.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden secrets and fun game modes to really give you a challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/063644661bd1b7fdc0d727d463de59a3.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor you climb could very well be your breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fight like a machine with soul and purpose.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698420/extras/a0454cadb72ef7878058a086470bcf7f.avif?t=1754832490\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "First Person Rogue-like with an incentive of choice. Set on a planet where a silent war between an alien race and a human soldier rage on. Craft your own build with self made weapons and personalized upgrades. Erratic enemies keep you on your toes so Fight like a machine with soul and purpose.",
